---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy — Angel0x1" description="How Angel0x1 handles your data: it doesn't leave your device.">
  <main class="wrap legal">
    <a href="/" class="eyebrow back">← Back</a>
    <h1 class="h2 italic">Privacy</h1>
    <p class="eyebrow faint">The short version</p>
    <p class="soft">
      Angel0x1 is built so your writing never leaves your phone. Journal entries,
      AI reflections, moods, and the picture the app builds of you are encrypted on
      your device and are never uploaded to any server. There is no account, and
      there is nothing for us to read, sell, or lose.
    </p>

    <h2 class="h3 italic">This website</h2>
    <p class="soft">
      This site collects no analytics, sets no tracking cookies, and loads no
      third-party scripts or fonts. The only thing it can collect is the email
      address you choose to submit to the waitlist.
    </p>

    <h2 class="h3 italic">The waitlist</h2>
    <p class="soft">
      If you join the waitlist, your email address is stored solely to notify you
      when the app launches and to grant early-access rewards. It is never sold,
      rented, or shared with third parties, and you can ask us to delete it at any
      time by replying to any message we send.
    </p>

    <h2 class="h3 italic">The app</h2>
    <p class="soft">
      All AI runs on-device (Apple Foundation Models or downloaded open-weight
      models). Your entries are sealed with AES-256-GCM using a key held in the
      device keychain. We operate no backend that can see your content.
    </p>

    <p class="eyebrow faint updated">Last updated {new Date().getFullYear()}</p>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal { max-width: 720px; padding-block: 140px 100px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; }
  .legal h2 { margin-top: 22px; }
  .back { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .updated { margin-top: 30px; }
</style>
